{"seq":3,"slug":"transfer-policy-config-override-governance","title":"调拨策略配置与人工干预治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/interwarehouse-transfer-rebalance/transfer-requirement-strategy/transfer-policy-config-override-governance","wordCount":2945,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"调拨策略配置与人工干预治理\">调拨策略配置与人工干预治理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-策略不是参数表-而是一份可治理的决策契约\">核心概念：策略不是参数表，而是一份可治理的决策契约</h2><p>调拨策略表面上是一堆阈值——安全库存水位、最低调拨量、成本上限、触发频率。把它当参数表来管，系统一定会在半年内失控：有人为救一个爆款把成本上限调高十倍，有人为压库存把触发水位改到零，改完没人记得为什么、依据是什么。真正要设计的不是「有哪些参数」，而是「谁在什么条件下可以改变它们、要留下什么证据、改错了怎么退回去」——这就是治理。</p>\n<p>一份可治理的策略包含三件缺一不可的事：<strong>决策规则</strong>（什么条件下、从哪个仓、向哪个仓、调多少）、<strong>变更权责</strong>（哪个角色、在哪个作用域、能改哪些字段、需几级审批）、<strong>证据链</strong>（每次生效配置与人工覆盖都留下不可篡改的 who/when/what/before/after/reason）。只做第一件，要么上线三个月后没人敢动配置（改错就批量生成几百条跨境调拨单），要么谁都敢改（改了没有任何后果）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[需求信号: 净仓位缺口] --&gt; B[按作用域解析出生效策略]&#10;  B --&gt; C{是否触发调拨}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[记录未触发原因]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[约束过滤: MOQ/成本上限/冻结窗口/禁运]&#10;  E --&gt; F{超出自动化阈值}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[自动生成调拨建议]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[人工审批闸门 maker-checker]&#10;  H --&gt;|批准| G&#10;  H --&gt;|驳回并覆盖| I[人工干预记录 + 理由码]&#10;  I --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; J[审计日志: 策略版本 + 输入 + 输出]\">flowchart TD\n  A[需求信号: 净仓位缺口] --&gt; B[按作用域解析出生效策略]\n  B --&gt; C{是否触发调拨}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[记录未触发原因]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[约束过滤: MOQ/成本上限/冻结窗口/禁运]\n  E --&gt; F{超出自动化阈值}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[自动生成调拨建议]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[人工审批闸门 maker-checker]\n  H --&gt;|批准| G\n  H --&gt;|驳回并覆盖| I[人工干预记录 + 理由码]\n  I --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; J[审计日志: 策略版本 + 输入 + 输出]</pre><p>表：三层配置对象的职责切分</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n<th>所有者</th>\n<th>审批</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>策略模板</td>\n<td>季度级</td>\n<td>供应链规划</td>\n<td>变更评审</td>\n<td>「欧洲区补货策略 v3」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实例参数</td>\n<td>周级</td>\n<td>区域计划员</td>\n<td>视字段</td>\n<td>德国仓安全库存水位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单次覆盖</td>\n<td>每次</td>\n<td>值班/计划员</td>\n<td>超阈值需双人</td>\n<td>大促临时放行 5 倍成本上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把三层混进一张「配置表」是治理崩溃的起点：模板变更是<strong>设计变更</strong>，实例参数是<strong>运营调整</strong>，单次覆盖是<strong>执行决策</strong>，审批强度、生效方式、回滚代价完全不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略的作用域与解析优先级\">策略的作用域与解析优先级</h2><p>跨境策略不可能只有一份。同一 SKU 在「全球默认」下允许跨洲调拨，在欧洲区受当地仓储成本约束，在某个履约中心又因盘点禁止出库。系统必须在运行时层层叠加成<strong>一份唯一生效的策略</strong>，否则同一笔建议单在不同模块算出不同结果，运维会失去信任。</p>\n<p>主流做法是<strong>最具体作用域优先</strong>，并区分两种合并语义：覆盖（子作用域字段直接替换父作用域，用于强约束如禁运、冻结窗口）与合并（子作用域只覆盖显式声明的字段，其余继承）。生效策略可写为从根到叶的链式替换：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>global</mtext></msub><msub><mo>▹</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>region</mtext></msub><msub><mo>▹</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>⋯</mo><msub><mo>▹</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>sku</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{eff}}(s) = P_{\\text{global}} \\triangleright_{\\theta_1} P_{\\text{region}} \\triangleright_{\\theta_2} \\cdots \\triangleright_{\\theta_k} P_{\\text{sku}}(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">global</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mbin\">▹</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">region</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mbin\">▹</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7211em;vertical-align:-0.2559em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mbin\">▹</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2559em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sku</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>▹</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\triangleright_{\\theta_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7154em;vertical-align:-0.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mbin\">▹</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是按字段集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 做的替换算子。<strong>白名单是治理的关键</strong>：某层若能覆盖任意字段，作用域设计即形同虚设；合规字段（禁运目的地、危险品限制）通常钉在最高层、对下层只读。</p>\n<p>这套结构在成熟系统里有直接对应：SAP S/4HANA 与 SAP EWM 用库存转储单（Stock Transport Order）的单据类型加工厂/存储地点级配置表达作用域差异（SAP Help Portal，<em>Inventory Management: Stock Transport Orders</em>）；Oracle Fusion Cloud Inventory Management 把调拨单及其审批规则绑定到库存组织层级（Oracle Fusion Cloud SCM 文档，<em>Inventory Management</em>）。共同点是<strong>作用域是一等公民</strong>。</p>\n<p>解析结果必须<strong>可解释</strong>：计划员问「为什么这个 SKU 没触发」，系统要能回放命中了哪一层、哪条规则、哪个阈值。只给布尔结果不给归因链，等于把策略黑箱化，一旦产生一次可疑建议，整条链路就会被人工接管。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可配置参数与阈值的建模\">可配置参数与阈值的建模</h2><p>把「哪些东西可配置」想清楚，比「怎么做成可配置」更重要。务实切分是按「是否需要业务判断」筛选：<strong>纯计算参数</strong>（公式系数、提前期）可配置但有默认；<strong>承载业务权衡的参数</strong>（成本上限、安全水位）必须配置且带审批；<strong>合规参数</strong>（禁运、数据驻留）不可由业务侧配置。</p>\n<p>调拨触发围绕净仓位展开，这是策略的第一段逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>NP</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>OnHand</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>InTransit</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>OnOrder</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>Reserved</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>SS</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NP}(i,w,t) = \\text{OnHand} + \\text{InTransit} + \\text{OnOrder} - \\text{Reserved} - \\text{SS}(i,w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NP</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OnHand</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">InTransit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OnOrder</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Reserved</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SS</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>NP</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NP} &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 出现净缺口才进入候选，再叠加成本可行性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>hold</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>滞销成本节约</mtext></munder><mo>−</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>transfer</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>调拨成本</mtext></munder><mo>−</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>缺货</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>残余缺货风险</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = \\underbrace{C_{\\text{hold}}\\cdot Q\\cdot T_h}_{\\text{滞销成本节约}} - \\underbrace{C_{\\text{transfer}}(Q,d)}_{\\text{调拨成本}} - \\underbrace{\\pi\\cdot \\mathbb{E}[\\text{缺货}]\\cdot T_s}_{\\text{残余缺货风险}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2041em;vertical-align:-1.5208em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4792em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">滞销成本节约</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.1576em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmln